# Public host names for the deployment. Committed on purpose (no secrets here): the 5-minute
# auto-update applies a change, and Caddy then obtains HTTPS certificates for the new names.
# Values here override the sslip.io defaults bootstrap.sh wrote to /opt/jordan-sports/staging.env.
# Before uncommenting, the DNS records in docs/domain.md must already point at the server,
# otherwise certificate requests fail (Caddy retries, but Let's Encrypt rate-limits failures).
#
# WEB_HOST=jorena.app
# ADMIN_HOST=admin.jorena.app
# WEB_BASE_URL=https://jorena.app
# WEB_ORIGINS=https://jorena.app
# ADMIN_ORIGINS=https://admin.jorena.app
# WEB_REDIRECT_HOSTS=www.jorena.app
#
# Search engines stay out (noindex) until launch; to allow indexing:
# X_ROBOTS_TAG=all
